      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T06:26:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, I\u0027ll go with the simple fix then. In tls_notify_app_accept I\u0027d check app_worker_get_if_valid (ctx-\u003eparent_app_wrk_index) first and refuse, and in http/quic check the listener\u0027s app_wrk_index before app_worker_init_accepted, and drop the session layer part. Will rerun the loss repro on it\n\nAbout tls_listener_ctx_get, I think it\u0027s because it\u0027s a release build, so the freed lctx was still readable with its old handle. The app had detached by then (vperf server stop detaches), so the app_wrk check should catch it",
